<title>HUNGARY: Styl to buy 10,000 own shares.</title>
<headline>Styl to buy 10,000 own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian clothing manufacturer Styl Ruhagyar Rt said it had commissioned a brokerage to buy back 10,000 of its own shares.</p>
<p>In a statement, published in the official bourse gazette this morning, Styl said the order, to be met at market price, was lodged on December 11.</p>
<p>The company did not give any reason for the purchase.</p>
<p>Styl has an issued share capital of 1.18 billion forints, made up of 1,000 forint face value shares.</p>
<p>On Wednesday Styl shares closed at 800 forints, unchanged from Tuesday. -- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
